										"description": "The looping track a TikTok carousel ad plays — an MP3 you uploaded, no larger than 10MB. Omitted leaves the ad's music untouched. Null removes it before launch; a submitted carousel takes a replacement track instead. TikTok-only.",
										"nullable": true,
										"properties": {
