			"post": {
				"description": "Creates a mailbox on one of the account's domains. The domain needs the `email` capability turned on. The address can be created and signed in to while email is still setting up, and it can send once email is `ready`. Give it to a team member with `user_id`, or leave it out to share the mailbox with the account. Creating an address this account deleted brings the mailbox back, with its mail and a new password.",
