				"description": "Restores access to a `canceled` or `expired` membership that contains only one-time purchases and sets its `status` to `completed`. Lifetime memberships regain lifetime access; for memberships with an expiration, `days` sets the new `current_period_end`. Active and recurring memberships cannot be reactivated.",
				"operationId": "reactivate",
				"parameters": [
					{
						"$ref": "#/components/parameters/ApiVersionDate"
