			"post": {
				"description": "Joins a free waitlist variant as the authenticated user, or on behalf of an account with `buyer_account_id`. Requires `waitlist_entry:create`, on that account when one is given. Joining again returns the existing pending signup, or the approved one while its membership is valid. Paid variants are rejected; joining collects no payment method and grants no membership.",
